Wrong contact merge	Confidence threshold and human review.
Cross-tenant data leak	Tenant-scoped queries, authorization middleware, isolation tests.
Infinite agent loop	Maximum depth, turn limits, timeout, cost ceiling.
Duplicate webhook processing	Provider event IDs and idempotent handlers.
