Prompt injection	Treat external content as untrusted data; restrict tool permissions.
Incorrect payment status	Trust only verified Stripe webhook events.
Outdated enrichment	Store source and freshness timestamps.
Poor CRM data quality	Validation, field provenance, duplicate detection.
High AI costs	Smaller models for classification, caching, budgets, and usage alerts.
Over-engineering	Deliver one complete workflow before expanding the platform.
